            <procstep>
                <procdesc>This district was identified from public records (including published maps and the National Register nomination form). and heads-up digitized using a combination of the 1995 orthophotographs and planimetric roads features. This dataset was not fitted to the master line dataset since it follows many property lines not in that dataset. It was created by buffering along the planimetric street centerline at specified distances, as referenced in the 1803 King Plats, ranging from 70 to 160 feet. Attribute data was provided by public records. Planimetrics were created at a scale of 1:1,000. This means that a well defined feature falls within two feet of the true position. All DC GIS data is stored and exported in Maryland State Plane coordinates NAD 83 meters.</procdesc>
                <procdate>20010806</procdate>
